From 47a70761eeccad7fd98fb9193f995d956246ef6f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Samuel Braun <sam@webry.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 14:30:20 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): one owner for git running; empty-stop rule out of
 App.vue

createGitRun owns the running flag for Abort and Continue; emptyStop
decides where git's stop message shows and keeps it across problems.

Refs #1407-#1416
